♪♪

00:04:53.701 --> 00:04:56.067
Up next, we have...

00:04:58.334 --> 00:04:59.400
He was voted...

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.968
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Oh,

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:04.501
because he's a little teapot.
-Yeah.

00:05:04.501 --> 00:05:06.400
They call him Little Teapot.
-He's both short and stout.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.167
-[ Southern accent ]
Here comes Little Teapot
around the corner.

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:11.200
-[ Matching accent ] Coming
right here, short and stout.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.200
