00:05:21.801 --> 00:05:23.200
"You only have rhombuses?

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.334
Oh, I'll come back."

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:25.400
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.467
Next up is...

00:05:28.167 --> 00:05:29.801
-Ooh!
-He was voted...

00:05:32.534 --> 00:05:36.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:36.267 --> 00:05:37.634
"I'm going to fight for you."

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.133
Up next, we have...

00:05:41.133 --> 00:05:42.601
[ Audience awws ]

00:05:42.601 --> 00:05:43.667
He was voted...

00:05:46.067 --> 00:05:51.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.834
-"You are full of beans."
-"Oh, you."

00:05:52.834 --> 00:05:54.234
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.234 --> 00:05:56.367
Do you like it? "Oh, you."
-"Yeah."

00:05:56.367 --> 00:05:58.434
-Next up, we have...

00:05:58.434 --> 00:05:59.868
-Ooh.
-He was voted...

00:06:03.334 --> 00:06:07.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:09.234
Next up, we have...

00:06:09.234 --> 00:06:10.601
-Oh.
-He was voted...

00:06:13.167 --> 00:06:15.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:15.467 --> 00:06:17.400
"Not today, not ever!"

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.934
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:06:19.934 --> 00:06:21.000
And, finally, we have...

00:06:22.968 --> 00:06:24.033
He was voted...

00:06:26.801 --> 00:06:28.200
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.801
There you have it.
Those are your "Superlatives."

